{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2105"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/ball-sports","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/sport-games__ball-sports.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",744],["+","The record book also has its famous gaps. Ivan Lendl, the dominant man of the mid-1980s, won eight majors – three French Opens, three US Opens and two Australian Opens – yet the one title he wanted most never came: he lost the Wimbledon finals of 1986 and 1987 and retired without ever winning Wimbledon. Boris Becker had the opposite problem. Champion at Wimbledon three times, he never won the French Open as a player, nor any clay-court title at all. He finally lifted that trophy, in a sense, as a coach: under Becker, Djokovic won the French Open on 5 June 2016, completing his own career Grand Slam.\n\n"],["=",30],["-","calendar "],["=",2],["-","Slam,"],["+","Slam"],["=",1],["+","in its original, strict sense – the name for winning "],["=",4],["-","tournaments"],["+","major"],["=",1],["-","in"],["+","championships"],["=",1],["+","within "],["=",2],["-","year."],["+","calendar"],["=",1],["+","year, a phrase borrowed from the card game of bridge in the 1930s. "],["=",269]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",678],["+","Das Rekordbuch kennt auch berühmte Lücken. Ivan Lendl, der beherrschende Spieler der mittleren 1980er-Jahre, gewann acht Majors – dreimal die French Open, dreimal die US Open und zweimal die Australian Open –, doch der Titel, den er sich am meisten wünschte, blieb aus: Er verlor die Wimbledon-Finals 1986 und 1987 und beendete seine Karriere, ohne je Wimbledon gewonnen zu haben. Boris Becker hatte das umgekehrte Problem. Dreimal Wimbledonsieger, gewann er als Spieler nie die French Open und überhaupt keinen Titel auf Sand. Diese Trophäe holte er gewissermaßen erst als Trainer: Unter Becker gewann Djokovic am 5. Juni 2016 die French Open und vollendete damit seinen eigenen Karriere-Grand-Slam.\n\n"],["=",26],["-","Kalender-Grand-Slam,"],["+","Grand"],["=",1],["-","alle"],["+","Slam"],["=",1],["+","im ursprünglichen, strengen Sinn – so heißt der Gewinn aller "],["=",2],["-","Turniere"],["+","großen"],["=",1],["+","Meisterschaften innerhalb eines Kalenderjahres, ein Begriff, der "],["=",2],["-","einem"],["+","den"],["=",1],["-","Jahr."],["+","1930er-Jahren"],["=",1],["+","dem Kartenspiel Bridge entlehnt wurde. "],["=",251]]}]},
